      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1195 - Jamil ibn Darraj narrated from Imam (as) regarding a man who led a congregation in prayer without wudu' (ritual purity), then left and appointed another man to lead, but the new leader did not know what the previous Imam had prayed.\nImam (as) said: \"Those behind him should remind him.\""
        ]
      }
